{"title":"마탄의 사수","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=3Qm4d/hzXalZz5eN/zcQLe4YNj69huF9GKKJdX0&filename=th3","synopsis":"\"하 중사, 이 미친놈아. 또 만발인 거 알아?\"\n\n이제 말뚝 박을 일만 남은 명사수 부사관 하이하.\n그러나 불의의 사고로 하반신을 못 쓰게 되어 사회로 내쳐졌다.\n절망에 빠져있던 그에게 혁명적인 VR 게임 [미들 어스]가 새로운 삶을 선사한다.\n가상현실 게임인 [미들 어스]에서 획득한 돈은 현실의 돈이 된다!\n\n하지만 캐릭터 생성 때 가장 성능이 낮은 캐릭터를 고르게 되는 바람에 망하게 생겼다!\n\n\"난 다르다. 이것이 내 마지막이야!\"\n\n흑색화약, 쇠구슬, 꼬질대. 진짜 '머스킷티어'가 무엇인지 보여주마!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":120,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":116,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":121,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":130,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":111,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":102,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":108,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":118,"change":{"type":"down","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":110,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":126,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":125,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":122,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":117,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":123,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":126,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":138,"change":{"type":"down","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":132,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":131,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":120,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":121,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":125,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":131,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"dat